{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":77341,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"David Lickley","original_name":"David Lickley","popularity":0.3418,"profile_path":"/xSnhcJES8RsVBjpEgqSXylzADWV.jpg","known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/lGfrl0eF189HifRGYPumrGUAqkt.jpg","id":50081,"title":"Born to Be Wild","original_title":"Born to Be Wild","overview":"Born to Be Wild observes various orphaned jungle animals and their day-to-day behavioural interactions with the individuals who rescue them and raise them to adulthood. The film unfurls in two separate geographic spheres. Half of it takes place in the rain forests of Borneo, where celebrated primatologist Dr. Birute Galdikas assists baby orangutans; the other half takes place on the arid savannahs of Kenya, where zoologist Dame Daphne Sheldrick works with baby elephant calves.","poster_path":"/78qdFtASdnBSOiqSvazDgxGcQHk.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[99,12],"popularity":1.4872,"release_date":"2011-04-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.027,"vote_count":73},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mQ6oFQDW7azUZZZ1rO8oEUIWEmq.jpg","id":14835,"title":"Bears","original_title":"Bears","overview":"From polar bears in the arctic tundra to black bears in the Northern Rockies, you'll see some of the most spectacular footage ever shot of these enterprising omnivores. Catch salmon with a group of hungry grizzlies on the McNeil River in Alaska. Crawl inside a den with a mother black bear and her cubs. Learn about the challenges facing each of these species as their habitat diminishes.","poster_path":"/2t5WrwlwF4tHmWUDzgGwLm2zeTX.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[99],"popularity":1.0779,"release_date":"2004-12-03","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/pMVY2NkVqIS8IKADO40z3dpnbrK.jpg","id":402980,"title":"Wonders of the Arctic","original_title":"Wonders of the Arctic","overview":"Wonders of the Arctic 3D centers on our ongoing mission to explore and come to terms with the Arctic, and the compelling stories of our many forays into this captivating place will be interwoven to create a unifying message about the state of the Arctic today. Underlying all these tales is the crucial role that ice plays in the northern environment and the changes that are quickly overtaking the people and animals who have adapted to this land of ice and snow.","poster_path":"/kILm34FUY8f9s2WlYVFNbzoGHfX.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[99,12],"popularity":0.846,"release_date":"2014-03-06","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":4}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}